  "summary_en": "Viewpoint in the Journal of Surgery Pakistan arguing that robotic surgery is overused, applying Maslow's law of the instrument. It questions cost-effectiveness, resident training and underreported complications, and calls for proper patient and procedure selection and independent, transparent data collection.",
